  "is_special_feature": true,
  "review": "<h2 id=\"intro\">【2026お盆直前】石川県・金沢・能登の直前予約できる温泉宿特集｜穴場スポット・直前割引プラン</h2>\n<p>お盆まであとわずか——でも諦めないでください。<strong>石川県</strong>エリアで直前予約可能な高評価ホテル・旅館を楽天トラベルのデータから集めました。</p>\n<div class=\"my-6 p-5 bg-white border border-emerald-950/20 rounded-2xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-emerald-900 border-b border-emerald-950/10 pb-2 mb-3\">📌 目次</h3>\n  <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-emerald-950/80 font-medium\">\n    <li><a href=\"#tips\" class=\"hover:text-emerald-600 hover:underline\">1. ⚡ お盆直前予約の4つの鉄則</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#ranking\" class=\"hover:text-emerald-600 hover:underline\">2. 🏨 石川県のお盆直前おすすめ宿一覧</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#faq\" class=\"hover:text-emerald-600 hover:underline\">3. 💡 よくある質問</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-emerald-950/10\" />\n<h2 id=\"tips\">⚡ 1. お盆直前予約の4つの鉄則</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-amber-950 text-sm\">① 3日前キャンセル戻り枠を毎日チェック</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-amber-950/80\">キャンセル料発生のタイミングで空室が一気に戻ります。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-teal-950 text-sm\">② 日程を1日前後にずらす</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-teal-950/80\">8/13〜14ピークを避けると空室率と料金が大幅改善。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-emerald-950 text-sm\">③ 楽天トラベル直前割引クーポン活用</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80\">「5と0のつく日」クーポン＋直前限定クーポンで大幅割引。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-rose-950 text-sm\">④ 郊外・穴場温泉エリアを狙う</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-rose-950/80\">有名観光地から30分圏内の郊外温泉街には空室が残りやすい。</p></div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-emerald-950/10\" />\n<h2 id=\"ranking\">🏨 2. 石川県のお盆直前おすすめ宿一覧</h2>\n<p>楽天トラベルの石川県エリア掲載宿から、高評価な施設を厳選掲載しています。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-cyan-500/10 border border-blue-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-blue-900 bg-blue-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">⚡ 直前予約おすすめ 第1位</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-800\">⭐ 4.13 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/109160/109160.jpg\" alt=\"金沢湯涌温泉　日本料理　さかえや\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-blue-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-blue-950\">金沢湯涌温泉　日本料理　さかえや</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-blue-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">全7室、部屋食で四季を味わう金沢の宿。ミシュラン『最上級の快適』を受賞。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F109160%2F109160.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      ⚡ 金沢湯涌温泉　日本料理　さかえやのお盆空室・プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-cyan-500/10 border border-blue-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-blue-900 bg-blue-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">⚡ 直前予約おすすめ 第2位</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-800\">⭐ 4.63 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/153452/153452.jpg\" alt=\"金沢湯涌温泉　百楽荘\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-blue-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-blue-950\">金沢湯涌温泉　百楽荘</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-blue-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">2022楽天ゴールドアワード＆日本の宿47☆ダブル受賞</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F153452%2F153452.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      ⚡ 金沢湯涌温泉　百楽荘のお盆空室・プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-cyan-500/10 border border-blue-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-blue-900 bg-blue-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">⚡ 直前予約おすすめ 第3位</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-800\">⭐ 4.64 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/38847/38847.jpg\" alt=\"金沢辰口温泉　まつさき\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-blue-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-blue-950\">金沢辰口温泉　まつさき</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-blue-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">温泉客室24室【鳳凰は露天風呂付】料理自慢＆全て個室食。金沢駅から電車と送迎で30分。お一人様歓迎</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F38847%2F38847.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      ⚡ 金沢辰口温泉　まつさきのお盆空室・プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-cyan-500/10 border border-blue-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-blue-900 bg-blue-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">⚡ 直前予約おすすめ 第4位</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-800\">⭐ 4.62 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/30835/30835.jpg\" alt=\"金沢湯涌温泉　湯の出旅館\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-blue-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-blue-950\">金沢湯涌温泉　湯の出旅館</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-blue-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">金沢市街から車で15分～20分。金沢の奥座敷。温泉と料理と趣贅沢にお愉しみいただける宿。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F30835%2F30835.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      ⚡ 金沢湯涌温泉　湯の出旅館のお盆空室・プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-cyan-500/10 border border-blue-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\"